(formerly known as Mega Market Trends) is a critical mid-quarter update of our Quarterly Investment Outlook which includes:\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe expected duration of this Quad4 bear market\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t32 core investment positions to protect (and grow) your capital\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Macro Context behind our current investment decisions\r\n\r\nThis exclusive webcast is available to Hedgeye Risk Manager subscribers⁠—our comprehensive bundle of risk management tools, superior investing ideas, and real-time macro insight. Hedgeye Risk Manager is currently available on Hedgeye.com for $2,499/year, save $500 with our Summer Sale.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/HRMsale/2gksmv2/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/HRMsale/2gksmv2/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\nQuestions Hedgeye Risk Manager or how to upgrade? Contact support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nmailto:Upgrade bundles\r\n\r\n and we'll respond as soon as possible.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nABOUT HEDGEYE\r\n\r\nHedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process.  The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing.  \r\n\r\nThe Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Energy, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, Industrials, Consumer Staples, Internet &amp; Media, Housing, Materials, Technology, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Energy, Healthcare, Telecom &amp; Media and Defense.\r\n\r\nUse of Hedgeye and any other products available through hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2022-08-29/2gksmv5/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n are subject to our Terms of Service\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/2gksmv8/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n and Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-b-/2gksmvc/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye/2gksmvg/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye-/2gksmvk/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/iption-center-add-user-hedgeye/2gksmvn/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n      \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ny-hedgeye-risk-management-llc/2gksmvr/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCopyright © 2022, All rights reserved.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tunsubscribe from all emails\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/unsubscribeConfirm/764243/28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd/915944242\r\n\r\n   update subscription preferences\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/emailpreferencecenter?ehash=28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd&amp;email_id=915944242&amp;epc_hash=fXM6qI1BTNHBpYigGrMancdsTd4fUrjxClqV1qUfIbg\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n","attachment_id":null},"read_attachment_supported":null,"parts":null},{"part_id":"1","mime_type":"text/html","filename":"","headers":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html; charset=\"utf-8\""},{"name":"Content-Transfer-Encoding","value":"8bit"}],"body":{"size":19734,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html;\" /><ti