presentation on key market and economic&nbsp;developments&nbsp;which will drive portfolio success this&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"background-color:#ffff33;\"><u>Thursday, September 1st&nbsp;at 11:00am ET</u>.</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ad2450;\"><em>This quarterly webcast (formerly known as Mega Market Trends)</em></span></strong>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a critical mid-quarter update of our <em>Quarterly Investment Outlook</em> which includes:</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>The expected <strong>duration of this <em>Quad4</em></strong> bear market</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>32 core investment positions</strong> to protect (and grow) your capital</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>The <u>Macro Context</u> behind our current investment decisions</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This exclusive webcast is available to <em>Hedgeye Risk Manager&nbsp;</em>subscribers⁠—our comprehensive bundle of risk management tools, superior investing ideas, and real-time macro insight. <strong><em>Hedgeye Risk Manager</em> is currently available on Hedgeye.com for $2,499/year, save $500 with our Summer Sale.</strong><br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/HRMsale/2gksmv2/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"259\" src=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/l/764243/2022-08-29/2gkslsj/764243/1661799246NFiDdvPt/2022_08_29_14_53_13.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 259px; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid;\" width=\"500\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/HRMsale/2gksmv2/915944242?h=SQpJGGdqIT9MKGvWN0_Bj6UdxDqvrWoxhcNlppjnURQ\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 150, 237);\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"654\" src=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/l/764243/2022-08-29/2gksktx/7